],"gloss":"living","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாளே","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"days"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"are the days of life indeed"}]}],"literal":"All what is the use? Chaff days / Like the lute tuned to Paṭumalai melody by bards, / as the sky's rising wall's good sound falls, / rained-upon pasture's blossomed jasmine's / fresh bud's pollen smelling fragrant forehead / young woman's pair of shoulders resting / passed days, here, are the living days indeed.","translation":"What is the use of all other days? They are but worthless chaff. Only those days spent resting on the shoulders of my young wife, whose fragrant forehead smells of the pollen of fresh jasmine buds that blossomed in the pasture after the rain fell, accompanied by the sweet thunder from the rising wall of clouds in the sky like the Paṭumalai melody played on the lute by bards—only those passed days are the days I truly lived.","modern":"வானத்தில் எழுந்த மேகக்கூட்டங்கள் என்னும் சுவரிலிருந்து, பாணர்கள் யாழில் வாசிக்கும் படுமலைப் பண் போன்ற இனிய இடி ஓசை ஒலிக்க, மழை பெய்த காட்டில் மலர்ந்த முல்லை மலரின் புதிய அரும்புகளில் உள்ள மகரந்தத்தின் நறுமணம் வீசும் நெற்றியைக் கொண்ட என் தலைவியின் தோள்களைத் தழுவித் துயின்ற நாட்களே நான் உண்மையாக வாழ்ந்த நாட்களாகும். மற்ற நாட்கள் எல்லாம் வெறும் பதர் போன்ற வீணான நாட்களே ஆகும்.","explanation":"The hero, having returned home after a long journey, speaks to himself or his companion about the value of his time. He declares that all the days he spent away from his beloved were completely useless, like empty chaff (பதடி). The only days that truly count as living are those spent resting on the shoulders of his young wife. The poem is set in the Mullai (forest) landscape, which is marked by the arrival of the rainy season and the blossoming of jasmine. The poet beautifully compares the deep, resonant sound of thunder from the dark cloud-walls to the sweet Paṭumalai melody played on the lute by bards, signaling the joyful return and reunion of the lovers.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.5],[2.5,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.49,3.73],[4.21,4.75],[4.75,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,5.83],[5.9,6.4],[6.4,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.4],[7.4,8.2],[8.2,8.52],[8.52,9.0],[9.0,9.5],[9.5,9.8],[9.8,10.4],[10.4,10.8],[10.8,12.0],[12.0,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.1]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.4],[1.4,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.53,4.1],[4.1,4.37],[4.37,5.7],[5.7,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.6,7.3],[7.3,7.6],[7.6,7.9],[7.9,8.7],[8.7,9.5],[9.5,10.0],[10.0,10.2],[10.2,10.8],[10.8,11.1],[11.1,12.3],[12.3,12.72],[12.8,13.8],[13.8,14.3],[14.3,14.8],[14.8,15.0]]},"sync":[[["எல்லாம்","all"]],[["எவனோ","of what use?"]],[["பதடி","chaff"]],[["வைகல்","days"]],[["பாணர்","bards"]],[["படுமலை","Paṭumalai melody"]],[["பண்ணிய","played"]],[["எழாலின்","like the lute"]],[["வானத்து","of the sky"]],[["வானத்து","of the sky"],["எழுஞ்சுவர்","rising wall (of clouds)"]],[["நல்லிசை","good sound (thunder)"]],[["வீழ","to fall"]],[["பெய்த","rained"]],[["புலத்து","in the pasture"],["பூத்த","blossomed"]],[["பூத்த","blossomed"]],[["முல்லை","jasmine"]],[["பசுமுகை","fresh bud"]],[["தாது","pollen"]],[["நாறும்","smelling fragrant of"]],[["நறுநுதல்","fragrant forehead"]],[["அரிவை","young woman"]],[["தோளிணை","pair of shoulders"],["துஞ்சி","resting"]],[["துஞ்சி","resting"]],[["கழிந்த","passed"]],[["நாள்","days"],["இவண்","here"]],[["வாழும்","living"]],[["நாளே","are the days of life indeed"]]]}